<mjml>
  <mj-body background-color="#f7eeea" width="600px">

    <mj-section background-color="#a64208" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-re-hero-60.jpg" alt="Volta vai! 10% OFF em todos os produtos" width="600px" href="https://repeatonline.com.br/discount/VOLTA10?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fall" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-if--primeiro_nome" background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="16px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="30px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="0px">Oi, {{primeiro_nome}}!</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-ifnot--primeiro_nome" background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="16px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="30px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="0px">Oi!</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="0px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="26px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17px" line-height="27px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">A gente subiu o seu desconto: agora são <strong>10% OFF em todos os produtos</strong>. É a desculpa que faltava pra voltar a repetir o que te faz bem.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="0px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column background-color="#ffffff" border="2px dashed #d4471a" border-radius="18px" padding-top="22px" padding-right="12px" padding-bottom="22px" padding-left="12px">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" font-weight="700" line-height="16px" letter-spacing="2.5px" color="#a64208" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="8px" padding-left="0px">SEU CUPOM DE 10% OFF</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="42px" font-weight="700" line-height="48px" letter-spacing="2px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="8px" padding-left="0px"><span style="white-space:nowrap;">VOLTA10</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" line-height="20px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">Em todos os produtos · 1 uso por cliente</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="24px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="40px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button href="https://repeatonline.com.br/discount/VOLTA10?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fall" background-color="#d4471a" color="#ffffff" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" border-radius="40px" inner-padding="18px 24px" width="100%" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="14px" padding-left="0px">USAR MEUS 10% OFF</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="19px" color="#8a4b3f" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">O botão já aplica o cupom no carrinho. Se preferir, digite <strong>VOLTA10</strong> no checkout.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="36px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="16px" padding-left="48px">
